WEBVTT

00:01.270 --> 00:03.320
Step right up for the show of the century!

00:03.810 --> 00:06.320
Drifting with the wind,
wherever the heart desires...

00:06.320 --> 00:09.160
Yes, we're none other than
the minstrel troupe, Masquerade!

00:09.160 --> 00:11.780
Pay what you think is—

00:12.780 --> 00:14.660
Quit flubbing so hard!

00:14.660 --> 00:17.370
My deepesth apologiesh!

00:19.580 --> 00:20.750
Come one, come all!

00:20.750 --> 00:23.170
Those far away, hear our songs!

00:23.170 --> 00:25.340
Those nearby, watch the dance as well!

00:25.340 --> 00:29.590
The Masquerade troupe is about
to sing, play, and dance!

00:30.340 --> 00:31.930
♪ Let us drink and sing ♪

00:31.930 --> 00:33.600
♪ You'll never tire of it ♪

00:33.600 --> 00:37.230
♪ Forget today's hardships ♪

00:37.230 --> 00:38.520
♪ Drink and sing ♪

00:38.890 --> 00:40.480
♪ Though the night stretches on ♪

00:40.480 --> 00:44.570
♪ Let us drink and rejoice ♪

00:44.570 --> 00:45.780
♪ That's right! ♪

00:45.780 --> 00:48.030
♪ Let's sing a song of joy ♪

00:48.030 --> 00:49.240
♪ That's right! ♪

00:49.240 --> 00:51.610
♪ Let it reach the moon ♪

00:51.610 --> 00:52.780
♪ That's right! ♪

00:52.780 --> 00:54.530
♪ Tomorrow too ♪

00:54.530 --> 00:57.120
♪ Drink, sing ♪

00:57.120 --> 01:00.210
♪ And then smile! ♪

01:15.180 --> 01:18.430
Connect this star and that star,

01:18.430 --> 01:22.010
and it forms the shape
of a guiltylowe's fang...

01:23.150 --> 01:24.900
I've had a revelation!

01:24.900 --> 01:27.480
"The Guiltylowe Won't Give Up Just Yet!"

01:27.480 --> 01:32.530
♪ Ah, push forward
through the fire and water! ♪

01:32.530 --> 01:34.450
♪ As long as your fangs remain— ♪

01:34.450 --> 01:37.830
Stop singing gibberish and go to sleep!

01:37.830 --> 01:39.540
We're waking up early tomorrow!

01:58.400 --> 02:00.480
Wait, why?!

02:00.840 --> 02:03.900
Thae showrunners call the shots
in the big cities.

02:04.350 --> 02:07.190
But us folk? We just sing free
an' easy in our wee village.

02:11.820 --> 02:13.360
Mum, Mum!

02:13.780 --> 02:16.120
Let's play "Sword Saint Reid" next time!

02:16.120 --> 02:17.080
Boom!

02:17.080 --> 02:17.910
Bam!

02:17.910 --> 02:19.240
Kapow!

02:21.370 --> 02:25.460
A pipsqueak like you is ten years too early
to be deciding our program!

02:29.020 --> 02:33.880
Mouthy brats dinnae get
a bite of rabbit meat, y'know?

02:34.630 --> 02:36.250
Quit yappin'!

02:36.930 --> 02:37.990
Liliana!

02:37.990 --> 02:39.100
Oi, what're ye doin'?

02:39.100 --> 02:41.990
I don't care what ye geezers do!

02:42.390 --> 02:44.850
I'm goin' to the city, ya hear?

02:49.240 --> 02:50.860
Just ye wait!

02:51.600 --> 02:54.570
I will become the Minstrel King!

04:28.920 --> 04:30.790
Lady Priscilla!

04:37.650 --> 04:38.890
Quiet.

04:43.640 --> 04:47.060
Compensation for my necklace
shall not be cheap.

04:47.060 --> 04:48.560
I see.

04:48.560 --> 04:52.810
So you can have the things you value
take damage in your stead.

04:53.480 --> 04:56.280
A rather prideful way of life...

04:56.280 --> 04:59.820
Even Iris and the Thorn King
would pale in comparison!

05:01.810 --> 05:05.080
Loathsome cur who pries
into the past of others...

05:05.080 --> 05:09.460
Not even ten thousand deaths
can atone for your trespasses!

05:09.830 --> 05:12.170
Please, do not be so angry.

05:12.170 --> 05:15.960
Wrath is the most detestable
emotion in this world.

05:15.960 --> 05:20.220
A person's heart should
always be filled with joy!

05:20.220 --> 05:22.590
Therefore, using my Authority,

05:22.590 --> 05:24.350
I will open people's hearts

05:24.350 --> 05:27.430
and build a true connection
based on empathy and understanding!

05:27.430 --> 05:32.770
That is the first step
toward mutual understanding, toward love!

05:33.200 --> 05:34.440
Eh?

05:34.440 --> 05:35.650
Are you stupid?

05:37.530 --> 05:38.610
Come again?

05:39.110 --> 05:41.570
Can't you see the people around us?

05:41.570 --> 05:44.320
You call that understanding one another?

05:44.320 --> 05:47.290
Is that what empathy
is supposed to look like?

05:47.720 --> 05:49.250
It's disgusting!

05:49.590 --> 05:51.960
If you really want to share
your emotions with someone,

05:52.370 --> 05:55.590
then shut up and listen to my music!

06:00.300 --> 06:02.510
Alas, you've finally revealed
your true colors.

06:03.970 --> 06:07.220
You silence all that is inconvenient.

06:07.220 --> 06:12.310
Did the diva wound you more than I did?

06:13.020 --> 06:15.810
No... no, no... no, no, no...

06:15.810 --> 06:17.650
That... That can't be!

06:17.650 --> 06:21.360
I would never act on impulse like that!

06:21.360 --> 06:25.200
You heard something that displeased you.

06:25.600 --> 06:27.120
And that enraged you.

06:27.570 --> 06:30.830
That is all, nothing but petty wrath.

06:31.910 --> 06:37.320
Do not sully the wrath of mine
and my precious!

06:38.000 --> 06:43.010
Wrath is the one and only gift
I received from my precious husband!

06:43.010 --> 06:47.140
Anger is the only thing your husband
gave you? What a joke!

06:47.500 --> 06:49.680
I've had eight husbands,

06:49.680 --> 06:54.100
and they all showered me
with gifts to keep my interest.

06:54.100 --> 06:55.440
Eight?!

06:55.850 --> 07:02.780
I've spent so much time devoting myself to
connecting with just that one man's heart!

07:02.780 --> 07:06.490
Do not blame me
for your own lack of charm.

07:06.490 --> 07:07.870
However,

07:07.870 --> 07:13.000
I do question whether that pitiful man
of yours even had eyes for you.

07:13.000 --> 07:18.210
He and I loved each other deeply!

07:36.390 --> 07:37.400
Lady Priscilla!

07:39.360 --> 07:41.150
Don't look away!

07:41.150 --> 07:45.440
Not when my wrath is about
to burn you to ashes!

07:46.030 --> 07:48.450
I need not my full attention
for the likes of you.

07:48.890 --> 07:51.870
Do not tell me what to do.

07:58.400 --> 08:00.460
Yours is a clumsy flame.

08:01.050 --> 08:05.630
I shall show you
how a "pioneer" blazes through.

08:12.930 --> 08:16.810
My flame consumes only what I decree.

08:17.520 --> 08:19.270
The stage is set.

08:19.270 --> 08:21.560
Do try to amuse me.

08:23.110 --> 08:26.650
Right, leave it to me!

08:38.410 --> 08:40.750
I'm already tired
just after running a little...

08:41.960 --> 08:45.760
I've taken it way too easy in this city!

08:46.170 --> 08:51.930
This is all Mr. Kiritaka
and everyone else's fault!

08:51.930 --> 08:55.060
But that's precisely why...

08:55.060 --> 08:58.560
I can't back down now!

08:59.020 --> 09:03.310
This is the grand stage of a lifetime!

09:05.610 --> 09:13.740
Time to cram all these burning feelings
into my song!

09:14.310 --> 09:15.410
Come one, come all!

09:15.410 --> 09:17.950
Those far away, hear my song!

09:17.950 --> 09:20.080
Those nearby, watch the dance as well!

09:20.540 --> 09:25.880
And those really far away,
I'll sing even louder, so hear me!

09:26.240 --> 09:30.880
This proud woman, Liliana Masquerade,
is about to sing, play, and dance!

09:31.630 --> 09:33.140
Now listen!

09:33.800 --> 09:35.970
"A Sky Overtaking the Morning Glow"!

11:12.110 --> 11:15.360
This is what it means
to embrace singing...

11:15.360 --> 11:17.320
To live alongside songs...

11:17.320 --> 11:19.560
To walk the path of the minstrel...

11:20.530 --> 11:23.540
My chest bounces with excitement...

11:23.910 --> 11:26.920
Not that I have much of a chest to bounce...

11:31.710 --> 11:33.260
A hero...

11:34.050 --> 11:37.760
... wouldn't die from this...

11:38.390 --> 11:39.640
Right...

11:39.640 --> 11:41.010
... a hero wouldn't...

11:44.430 --> 11:47.650
... but I'm no hero...

11:48.650 --> 11:49.860
I mean...

11:49.860 --> 11:53.230
Reid or Flugel would never
have ended up like this...

11:53.900 --> 12:01.480
I'm just a petty thief who shares
their stories without their permission...

12:02.790 --> 12:03.830
Then...

12:04.370 --> 12:05.490
Then...

12:06.710 --> 12:08.460
What exactly...

12:10.290 --> 12:11.290
... is a minstrel?

13:09.940 --> 13:12.900
This entire thing... is a song.

13:32.330 --> 13:33.750
I've had a revelation!

13:43.300 --> 13:49.980
♪ Still, the morning comes ♪

13:49.980 --> 13:56.610
♪ It comes for everyone ♪

13:56.610 --> 14:07.120
♪ A blue sky overtaking the morning glow ♪

14:30.180 --> 14:39.270
♪ The new morning
dyes the sky gold and crimson ♪

14:39.980 --> 14:50.160
♪ Quietly,
as if forgetting yesterday's clamor ♪

14:50.160 --> 14:52.200
It's useless!

14:52.830 --> 14:55.370
From a place like that,
with a voice like yours!

14:55.370 --> 14:58.340
You think your song will reach anyone?!

14:59.130 --> 15:09.350
♪ Chasing away the night, a new day begins ♪

15:09.350 --> 15:19.520
♪ It overtakes the morning's
gold-crimson glow ♪

15:20.400 --> 15:29.280
♪ The true morning finally arrives ♪

15:32.760 --> 15:35.910
I want to have you all to myself.

15:36.970 --> 15:40.630
But a voice like yours
shouldn't belong to just one person.

15:41.300 --> 15:43.130
The Songstress belongs to everyone.

15:43.130 --> 15:45.010
But Liliana shall be mine.

15:45.010 --> 15:47.010
Is it wrong for me to wish for that?

15:50.470 --> 15:53.140
♪ Still, the morning comes ♪

15:53.140 --> 15:56.350
♪ Still, the morning comes ♪
Liliana, my Songstress!

15:57.140 --> 16:01.730
Your voice has the power
to bring happiness to all!

16:03.650 --> 16:14.040
♪ The blue sky overtakes the morning glow ♪

16:23.500 --> 16:27.720
My eyes did not deceive me.

16:27.720 --> 16:28.590
Why?

16:28.590 --> 16:31.260
The way that simpleton acts
is most gratifying.

16:31.260 --> 16:33.720
A simpleton and a fool
are similar yet different.

16:34.310 --> 16:36.850
A fool has no worth in life,

16:36.850 --> 16:39.600
but a simpleton, at least,
has the virtue of being entertaining.

16:39.980 --> 16:45.530
And that simpleton has demonstrated
worth beyond mere amusement.

16:45.530 --> 16:49.480
Therefore, I shall reward her efforts.

16:49.990 --> 16:53.330
JUST SHUT UP ALREADY!!!

16:53.330 --> 16:58.820
CRUMBLE AND BURN TO CINDERS,
FALSE SONGSTRESS!!!

17:06.260 --> 17:09.130
Fool! What do you think
you're doing with my property?!

17:09.130 --> 17:11.640
You as well, you haughty bitch!

17:23.480 --> 17:24.730
You dare...!

17:34.870 --> 17:37.290
I commend your resolve!

17:37.290 --> 17:39.330
Don't make me laugh!

17:40.160 --> 17:43.750
People wish for understanding
and empathy above all!

17:43.750 --> 17:45.290
Foolish wench.

17:45.290 --> 17:47.550
To become one is love!

17:47.550 --> 17:48.800
Wrong.

17:49.250 --> 17:52.430
Love is the tolerance
to accept differences.

17:52.950 --> 17:56.720
The thought of every single person
seeing, thinking,

17:56.720 --> 17:59.770
and feeling the same way makes me sick!

18:03.810 --> 18:05.270
It ends here.

18:05.680 --> 18:08.230
I wouldn't be so sure!

18:14.780 --> 18:17.660
Your heart pities this girl!

18:17.660 --> 18:20.410
That is the love now budding within you—

18:22.540 --> 18:23.670
Enough drivel.

18:33.300 --> 18:36.180
My Yang Sword burns only
what I wish to burn

18:36.180 --> 18:38.390
and cuts only what I wish to cut.

18:39.640 --> 18:44.230
My pain... do you...?

18:44.940 --> 18:46.690
Why would I feel your pain?

18:47.110 --> 18:51.900
Die alone as you drown in your delusions!

19:07.790 --> 19:11.420
The sunlight fades...
so the sun is in the shadow.

19:12.010 --> 19:14.470
That foul wretch has the devil's luck.

19:24.140 --> 19:25.690
- You alright?!
- Hey!

19:26.190 --> 19:29.690
A noisy crowd for a noisy night.

19:29.690 --> 19:33.150
Now is supposed to be the time
for a song, and yet...

19:33.150 --> 19:34.840
- Is the Songstress okay?!
- All I see is negligence.

19:34.840 --> 19:36.860
- Liliana!
- All I see is negligence.

19:37.860 --> 19:39.570
Disappointing.

19:40.240 --> 19:42.700
But it was not bad.

19:43.250 --> 19:45.080
You have my praise.

19:50.040 --> 19:53.130
Looks like I'm at my limit...

19:53.130 --> 19:57.340
A lot happened, but all in all,
it was a fun life...

19:58.680 --> 20:01.510
Liliana!

20:06.140 --> 20:08.170
Are you okay, Liliana?!

20:08.170 --> 20:11.770
M-Mr. Kiritaka?!
Where tha' heck ye been all this time?

20:11.770 --> 20:15.190
The demibeasts had me
running around panicking,

20:15.190 --> 20:17.070
but your song brought me to my senses.

20:17.070 --> 20:21.660
Oh dear, Mr. Kiritaka, what a disgraceful
sight that must've been...

20:22.240 --> 20:23.410
Liliana!

20:23.910 --> 20:25.000
Liliana!

20:25.000 --> 20:29.080
I'm really sleepy right now,
so I'm gonna take a nap...

20:29.080 --> 20:33.130
I've hit my limit... but don't worry,
I'm not gonna die.

20:33.130 --> 20:34.500
Liliana!

20:35.260 --> 20:39.470
I know I'll never say this
to your face, but...

20:39.470 --> 20:40.180
LILIANA MASQUERADE

20:40.180 --> 20:43.970
LILIANA MASQUERADE
I'm glad to be your Songstress.

22:14.520 --> 22:19.690
You Archbishops all have the same names
as the stars in my homeland,

22:20.120 --> 22:24.910
and your Authorities
are all connected to those names.

22:25.620 --> 22:28.490
Petelgeuse comes from "the hand of Jauza"—

22:28.490 --> 22:30.910
in other words, "The Unseen Hand."

22:31.580 --> 22:34.620
And Regulus,
part of the Leo constellation,

22:34.620 --> 22:35.920
means "Little King."

22:35.920 --> 22:39.210
But it has another name: Cor Leonis.

22:41.090 --> 22:43.340
In other words, the Lion Heart.

22:43.770 --> 22:46.760
Your authority
doesn't make you invincible,

22:46.760 --> 22:49.060
but rather, stops your time.

22:50.020 --> 22:54.810
If your body's time is frozen,
that means it doesn't change.

22:54.810 --> 22:57.610
No injuries, no getting wet.

22:57.610 --> 23:00.820
Even the sand you throw or the water
you splash stays frozen in time—

23:00.820 --> 23:02.110
Now listen here!

23:02.110 --> 23:05.820
I couldn't care less about what you think!

23:06.280 --> 23:09.870
Listening to you was a waste of time,
truth be told!

23:17.710 --> 23:18.880
Over there...

23:18.880 --> 23:20.800
That's the Little Kingdom,

23:20.800 --> 23:22.960
where the Little King
reigns over his brides!

23:23.380 --> 23:26.930
There has to be a limit
to Regulus' Authority!

23:27.340 --> 23:29.390
Be it the number of brides
or the distance...

23:29.390 --> 23:31.890
There has to be some kind of condition!

23:32.310 --> 23:34.230
I'm counting on you, Emilia!

23:34.230 --> 23:38.480
Get those brides out of
the Little Kingdom!
